{
  "id": "sentence-completion-test",
  "term": "sentence-completion test",
  "definition": "A sentence-completion test is a projective assessment in which people are asked to finish sentence stems, with their responses used to reveal underlying psychological characteristics. In psychology it is valued because it can be given to groups, scored more objectively than some other projective methods, and may be less affected by deliberate impression management than standard questionnaires.",
